Meshtonic — multi-license notice
================================

Copyright (c) 2026 Josephrp and Meshtonic contributors.

This repository is a monorepo. Different trees carry different licenses.
There is no single license that applies to every file.

1. First-party hardware design
------------------------------
Paths: pcb/, case/

SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-P-2.0

Full text: LICENSES/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.txt
https://spdx.org/licenses/CERN-OHL-P-2.0.html

This covers schematics, PCB layouts, BOMs, fab artifacts, and enclosure
CAD produced for the Meshtonic H4M Companion.

2. First-party documentation and media
--------------------------------------
Paths: README.md, static/, and this LICENSE file

SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0

Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

3. Firmware (third-party trees + Meshtonic board support)
--------------------------------------------------------
Paths under firmwares/ keep the license of their containing project.
Meshtonic-specific board support and apps added inside those trees follow
the same license as the host tree unless a file says otherwise.

| Path | License |
|------|---------|
| firmwares/meshtastic/ | GPL-3.0-only — see firmwares/meshtastic/LICENSE |
| firmwares/mayhem-firmware/ | GPL-3.0 — see that tree |
| firmwares/mayhem-mdk/ | HTL (custom; no commercial use) — firmwares/mayhem-mdk/LICENSE |
| firmwares/mayhem-mdk/lora-wideband-decoder/ | See that subtree’s LICENSE |
| firmwares/pin_mapping.cpp | CERN-OHL-P-2.0 (shared with the hardware design) |

Upstream copyrights remain with their respective authors. Do not treat a
vendored firmware tree as re-licensed by this root notice.

4. Third-party libraries inside pcb/
------------------------------------
KiCad symbol/footprint libraries under pcb/libs/ may carry their own
upstream licenses (for example Seeed Fusion / Grove libraries). Those
licenses are unchanged by this notice.
